    "Parent importer happy-path integration is parent-owned. Unusual path characters, unusually long environment/version labels and large nondefault inventories exceeding importer per-array cardinalities have not been qualified against its narrower validation; parent independent review should retain these as interoperability gaps.",
    "The collector does not inherit the test runner Landlock/seccomp sandbox when copied to a host. Concurrent mount/ancestor rename adversaries and uninterruptible I/O have not received independent qualification."
  ],
